# Line endings of the files whose SHA-256 is recorded and checked (supplied model cards,
# datasets, SPICE references, metadata, netlists). These rules make a fresh clone reproduce
# the exact bytes the hashes were computed on, independent of the local core.autocrlf
# setting and of the operating system. Everything else follows the user's Git defaults.

# supplied BSIM4 model cards: byte-exact as supplied (LF)
*.pm      -text

# files written by the project on Windows (CRLF), hashed in metadata / audit
*.csv     text eol=crlf
*.json    text eol=crlf
*.cir     text eol=crlf
*.net     text eol=crlf

# binary artefacts
*.joblib  binary
*.png     binary
*.pdf     binary
*.zip     binary
